{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VdxWQJh4J81794900081.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「證券無紙化」周一啟動，有股份過戶處指，目前已有逾2,200人登記「持股易」戶口，逐步將實體股票電子化。</p><p></p><p>Computershare亞洲發行人服務行政總裁熊瑞律表示：「雖然昨天法例才正式生效，我們現在已多於2,200名股東做了這件事、做這登記手續，下一個里程碑將是發行人陸續轉型為無紙模式上市。昨天我們都開始幫另一個客戶，做第一個無紙證券市場下上市，在這件事上送舊迎新，大家都非常自豪。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.795700+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T07:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:02:12.297063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:13.506133+00:00","content_hash":"56e7be13d7639cdc2e0d6d4dd1af4070d8986d92eac69cfbc00319a12ed002fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.795700+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}